Subject: [PATCH] test: satisfy pre-commit gates (SPDX, mypy, ruff)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Pre-commit merge-gate failures from advisor review (2026-08-04 09:02):

- Add SPDX license/copyright headers to all 7 new Python files
  (check-spdx-header).
- b134_descriptor_layout.py: rename the os.open() file descriptor from
  descriptor to d — the loop variable descriptor (dict) and the fd
  shared one name, causing 3 mypy errors.
- test_b134_chain_contract.py: narrow node.end_lineno (int | None) before
  comparison.
- test_b134_scheduler_restore.py: fix type: ignore codes (method-assign
  for __getattr__ assignment; attr-defined for dynamic PauseState stub).

Local: 13 b134 tests pass; mypy clean on all 7 files; ruff check/format
clean.

Co-authored-by: Hermes Agent
